WEBVTT

NOTE
This file was generated by Descript <www.descript.com>

00:00:00.610 --> 00:00:03.560
Abraham: Recently using personal
devices has become more commonplace

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:04.880
in working environments.

00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:09.389
But it means that employees will hop
between corporate tools and personal

00:00:09.389 --> 00:00:12.970
applications introducing several
risks associated with allowing

00:00:13.139 --> 00:00:16.459
the use of personal devices in
conjunction with company networks.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:21.350
Many companies have a BYOD policy
of 'bring your own device' to work,

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:24.760
which allows their employees to use
their own personal devices to save

00:00:24.780 --> 00:00:28.310
time and money, as they are often
more productive than when using those

00:00:28.330 --> 00:00:30.430
provided in the working environment.

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:35.350
Individuals are much more inclined to
update their devices more often and

00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:39.190
keep all their apps and information up
to date in their own time, therefore,

00:00:39.190 --> 00:00:41.130
saving time and money for the business.

00:00:41.690 --> 00:00:45.190
However, businesses that let their
employees use their own personal

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:49.819
devices are at risk from data
theft, malware, legal problems

00:00:50.059 --> 00:00:51.579
and lost and stolen devices.

00:00:52.930 --> 00:00:56.139
It also makes it difficult in case there
is an incident in which the company

00:00:56.139 --> 00:01:00.300
would have to take the personal device
off the employee to investigate, leading

00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:04.083
to potentially embarrassing, whilst the
team conduct forensic investigations.

00:01:04.083 --> 00:01:09.309
Employees should be fully aware
of any issues regarding the use of

00:01:09.309 --> 00:01:13.270
personal devices regarding security
of data and responsibility for that.

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:16.990
Mobile security should be as
strong as network security, so as

00:01:16.990 --> 00:01:18.700
not to put the company at risk.

00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:24.169
The use of removable devices such as
laptops and tablets or even hard drives,

00:01:24.420 --> 00:01:28.060
can cause conflicts when they are used for
personal reasons as well as for business.

00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:31.209
This has become more of an
issue with remote working.

00:01:31.209 --> 00:01:34.679
Company devices should be kept
strictly for work so as not to open

00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:38.250
employees and business to conflict
of interest and security issues.

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:41.919
Also damage and theft as well as
misuse, that may open all parties

00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:45.380
to legal issues with regards to
data protection and security, and

00:01:45.380 --> 00:01:47.150
exposure to other cyber crimes.

